# C8 PRODUCT complex (PC): full-system B97-3c Opt Freq TightOpt, 21-atom QM1.
#
# Seed: ../irc_bridge/job_IRC_B.xyz, the backward IRC endpoint -- product-like
# (C128-O133 1.423 A formed, carbonyl stretched, the proton relayed off O133
# onto the water O131). The IRC hit MaxIter, so this seed is a direction, not a
# minimum; this relaxation turns it into one.
#
# Same QM1 as the bridge TS (21 atoms), same full-system/TightOpt standard.
! QM/XTB B97-3c ddCOSMO(Water) Opt Freq TightOpt TightSCF

%QMMM
QMATOMS
	{55 58 61 64 120 121 122 123 124 125 126 127 128 129 130 131 132 133 134 135 136}
END
Charge_total 0
Mult_total 1
AutoFF_QM2_Method GFNFF
END

%geom
  MaxIter 400
  Calc_Hess true
end

%output jsonpropfile true end

%maxcore 4000

%pal
   nprocs 8
end

* xyzfile 0 1 job.xyz
